Bug ID	Bug Title	Description	Steps to Reproduce	Expected Result	Actual Result	Severity	Priority	Status
BUG-001	Login error message validation	Verify that the login error message is clear and accurate when invalid credentials are entered.	1. Open SauceDemo login page. 2. Enter invalid username. 3. Enter invalid password. 4. Click Login.	A clear and accurate error message should be displayed.	Error message is displayed when invalid credentials are entered.	Medium	Medium	New
BUG-002	Locked user login validation	Verify that a locked-out user cannot access the application.	1. Open login page. 2. Enter locked_out_user. 3. Enter secret_sauce. 4. Click Login.	User should not be allowed to log in and an appropriate error should be displayed.	Locked-out user receives an error message and cannot log in.	High	High	New
BUG-003	Invalid username login validation	Verify system behavior when an invalid username is entered with a valid password.	1. Open login page. 2. Enter wrong_user. 3. Enter secret_sauce. 4. Click Login.	User should not be logged in and an appropriate error message should be displayed.	Error message is displayed and user remains on the login page.	Medium	Medium	New
BUG-004	Invalid password login validation	Verify system behavior when a valid username is entered with an invalid password.	1. Open login page. 2. Enter standard_user. 3. Enter wrong123. 4. Click Login.	User should not be logged in and an appropriate error message should be displayed.	Error message is displayed and user remains on the login page.	Medium	Medium	New
BUG-005	Empty username validation	Verify that the system validates an empty username field.	1. Open login page. 2. Leave username empty. 3. Enter secret_sauce. 4. Click Login.	System should display a username-required validation message.	Username-required error message is displayed.	Medium	Medium	New
